1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,927
Five steps, in this order.

2
00:00:01,927 --> 00:00:09,205
Skim: ninety seconds for the title, the first sentence of every paragraph and the last sentence of the passage.

3
00:00:09,205 --> 00:00:16,184
Read the questions, all of them, before you read the passage properly, and underline the key word in each.

4
00:00:16,184 --> 00:00:22,226
Scan and mark: hunt each key word in the passage, and write the question number in the margin.

5
00:00:22,226 --> 00:00:27,174
Write, question by question, from the marked lines, with the passage open.

6
00:00:27,174 --> 00:00:28,177
And check.

